\r
\e[3m\e[38;2;150;152;150mReading the file with the combining\e[0m\r
\e[3m\e[38;2;150;152;150mmarks in its name.\e[0m\e[0m\r
\r
The name is written \e[38;2;192;128;80mcafé\e[0m rather than\r
\e[38;2;192;128;80mcafé\e[0m, so the accent is a mark of its\r
own.\r
\r
A family 👨‍👩‍👧 is one glyph joined from\r
several, and a heart ❤️ asks to be drawn\r
in colour.\r
\r
Combining marks pile up too: á̂̃̄ is one\r
letter under four of them.\r
\r
A spacing mark is not a combining one:\r
Thai \e[38;2;192;128;80mกำ\e[0m and Devanagari \e[38;2;192;128;80mकि\e[0m are two\r
characters apiece, and each takes the\r
one cell its base took.\r
\r
A keycap 1️⃣ asks for two, where a bare 1⃣\r
keeps the one its digit had.\r
\r
